## ⚡ **Quick Commands (Copy & Paste)**

### **Check if running:**
```bash
launchctl list | grep gridbot
```

### **Stop bot:**
```bash
launchctl stop com.gridbot.webui
```

### **Start bot:**
```bash
launchctl start com.gridbot.webui
```

### **Restart bot:**
```bash
launchctl stop com.gridbot.webui && launchctl start com.gridbot.webui
```

### **Open dashboard:**
```bash
open http://localhost:5555
```

### **View logs:**
```bash
tail -20 webui_backend.log
```

---

## 🆘 **Emergency: Bot Not Working?**

### **Quick Fix (Works 90% of time):**
```bash
cd /Users/shailendrasinghrajawat/Documents/WorkingBot
launchctl stop com.gridbot.webui
sleep 2
launchctl start com.gridbot.webui
sleep 2
open http://localhost:5555
```

Just copy all those lines at once, paste in Terminal, press Enter.

